- CLSIDFromProgID: case-insensitive HKCR\<ProgID>\CLSID lookup via the
  W32A-9 advapi32 hive view; typed refusals (E_INVALIDARG/87,
  CO_E_CLASSSTRING+123/+2/+13); S_OK leaves last-error untouched;
  w32a11-progid-probe lines now carry result=0x%08x.
- CoCreateInstance: REAL over committed EMPTY activation table
  (W32_COM_CLASS_COUNT==0 pinned; zero CLSID/IID pairs observed in the
  pinned-app probes) — E_POINTER/E_INVALIDARG/CLASS_E_NOAGGREGATION/
  E_NOTIMPL for out-of-process ctx/REGDB_E_CLASSNOTREG in-proc; output
  always cleared.
- BufferedPaintRenderAnimation: live-buffer snapshot blit without
  holding ux_lock over BitBlt; TRUE no-op, FALSE+INVALID_HANDLE on bad
  target, INVALID_PARAMETER on NULL rect.
- stub_map rows 218/219/408 TODO->REAL with evidence notes; generator
  special-cases removed; generated surface regenerated (105 stubs).
- Guest probe fixture seeds HKCR in-guest (RegCreateKeyExW/SetValueExW),
  exit 78 only when positive hit + typed refusals agree; host tests:
  probe 56 / com 203 / theme 265 checks, 0 failures.
- Gates: test_w32a11_core_subset 20/20, theme 9/9, dragdrop 11/11,
  tokens 7/7; ledger gap unchanged (41); docs updated.
